cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FlahaX, please cite it as below."
title: "FlahaX: fertilizer salt selection for a fixed crop formula"
abstract: >-
  FlahaX chooses fertilizer salts and the grams of each salt so that a fixed
  crop formula, after subtraction of the season's water, is met with the
  smallest percentage error the salt library allows.
type: software
authors:
